--- b3 medium.en: Every rule here comes from official sources, IRS Publication 523, the IRS Tax Topic Pages, the Social Security Administration's rules on Medicare premiums, and the Medicare Fact Sheets. We will cover five things. Who qualifies, how the gain is counted and taxed, what it does to Medicare and Social Security, the cases that change the amount, and what happens to your family.
