--- b16 medium.en: Number four is the exceptions that change your limit, and the first is a partial exclusion. If you miss the two-year tests, you can still get part of it when the main reason you sold was a work move, a health reason, or an unforeseeable event. Health includes moving for treatment, caring for a sick family member, or a doctor's advice. The formula, months lived there, divided by 24 times $250,000. 12 months gives a single owner $125,000.
